Package: oodig
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: DNS LOOKUP
 Comprehensive DNS lookup utility querying specific record types (A, AAAA, MX, TXT).
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
